+# [flashkda] GLM53_KDA_FLASHKDA=1 (unset/empty/0 = stock) -> the bundle overlay patch_flashkda.py: the KDA
+#   chunked prefill runs FlashKDA 17a037d (_flashkda_fp32_C, fp32 recurrent state; 2.4x the Triton chain per
